# Use precise, specific language in findings; avoid vague (preference)

Standing user preference: Use precise, specific language in findings; avoid vague phrasing (e.g., write 'EXIF DateTimeOriginal field shows hex editor signature' rather than 'seems tampered').

## Conventions
- Use precise, specific language in findings; avoid vague phrasing (e.g., write 'EXIF DateTimeOriginal field shows hex editor signature' rather than 'seems tampered').

